### Generate 10 Keyboard parts

### 1. Add Apple MacBook Pro 16 Keyboard (Laptop)
POST {{host}}{{part_mapping}}/parts
Authorization: Bearer {{staff_auth_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="price"

6500.00
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="quantity"

12
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Apple MacBook Pro 16 Magic Keyboard Assembly
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="specifications"

US English layout, backlit, scissor mechanism with Touch ID
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="manufacturerId"

2
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="deviceTypeId"

1
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="partTypeId"

8
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="deviceModels"

A2141
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="partImage"; filename="keyboard01.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./assets/part_image/keyboard01.jpg

--WebAppBoundary--

